OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA bright and chilly start for
OL,6,Fmost, with rural frost. Isolated
OL,7,Fcoastal showers during the morning.
OL,8,FClouding over from the west during the
OL,9,Fafternoon, with rain arriving in the
OL,10,Fwest by early evening.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FOvercast with rain, moderate
OL,13,For heavy at times, spreading eastwards
OL,14,Facross the whole of the region by the
OL,15,Fmorning. Winds will strengthen and
OL,16,Flocally blustery along the coast.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
