OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CFriday:FCloudy with rain at first,
OL,6,Fthen sunny spells and blustery showers
OL,7,Fduring the afternoon. The showers will
OL,8,Fgradually ease and become more
OL,9,Fisolated overnight.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FWindy
OL,12,FSaturday, with sunny spells and
OL,13,Fshowers. Dry, with a mix of cloudy
OL,14,Fperiods and sunny spells on Sunday,
OL,15,Fwind easing. Becoming cloudy with rain
OL,16,FMonday afternoon, breezy at times.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
